          "responseSetKey": "texi_self_1_5",
          "randomizeOptions": false
        },
        {
          "itemCode": "TEXI-10",
          "content": "I find it difficult to make myself stop an activity that I like (e.g., I sit in front of the computer or mobile device even though it is time to go to bed)",
